EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting us regarding the status of your application.

Once your application status has changed to In Review, your application file is complete and in evaluation for admission. Application evaluations typically take four to six weeks before an admission decision is made.

Your application status will be updated on My ASU at http://my.asu.edu/ as soon as an admission decision is made.

Please let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
